      "answer": "Rub alcohol-based hand rub for 20 to 30 seconds when hands are not visibly soiled, or rub until hands are dry, which usually takes about 20 seconds. Rub the palms together, then the backs of the hands, between the fingers, the backs of the fingers, the thumbs and the fingertips, and continue until the hands are dry.",
